WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.266 --> 00:00:06.366
Our heroes arrived in Sanpei's hometown of Ninja Village,

2
00:00:06.433 --> 00:00:11.566
a lovely, peaceful place filled with hard-working ninja and Pokémon.

3
00:00:11.633 --> 00:00:15.100
And then, a mysterious ninja force appeared

4
00:00:15.166 --> 00:00:17.833
and made off with the village chief, Hanzo.

5
00:00:19.833 --> 00:00:21.766
Team Rocket?!

6
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:27.300
Yipes. You tried to catch a Pokémon and wind up with two twerps instead!

7
00:00:27.366 --> 00:00:29.733
Excuse me, those two don't need a fan club.

8
00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:31.300
Wobbuffett.

9
00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:33.766
Double yipes!

10
00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:34.766
Huh?

11
00:00:34.833 --> 00:00:38.266
- What happened?
- That was a ninja body switch.

12
00:00:38.333 --> 00:00:40.900
It's the power of the ninja.

13
00:00:45.066 --> 00:00:49.333
We're suddenly blasting off again!

14
00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:54.700
You're not stopping me.

15
00:00:54.766 --> 00:00:58.633
Pikachu, Electro Ball. Frogadier, Water Pulse. Now, let's go!

16
00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:01.266
Greninja, Water Shuriken!

17
00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:07.766
Greninja!

18
00:01:07.833 --> 00:01:10.133
Dodge it, then Shadow Claw.

19
00:01:12.633 --> 00:01:13.733
Bisharp!

20
00:01:17.166 --> 00:01:18.133
Bisharp!

21
00:01:21.233 --> 00:01:24.466
- Hey, are you guys okay?
- All of you hang in there.

22
00:01:29.166 --> 00:01:30.266
Bisharp.

23
00:02:11.566 --> 00:02:14.633
Is that all you've got? Bisharp, Shadow Claw!

24
00:02:15.866 --> 00:02:18.333
Frogadier, use your Frubbles to stop it.

25
00:02:22.900 --> 00:02:24.666
- Yes!
- Night Slash, go!

26
00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:27.733
All right, X-Scissor!

27
00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:29.400
Bisharp!

28
00:02:30.033 --> 00:02:31.766
Greninja!

29
00:02:33.533 --> 00:02:36.800
- Greninja, no!
- Pikachu, now use Thunderbolt. Go!

30
00:02:38.366 --> 00:02:39.700
Snarl!

31
00:02:54.966 --> 00:02:56.066
Pika, pika.

32
00:02:56.366 --> 00:02:58.066
Huh? Whoa, check it out!

33
00:03:00.266 --> 00:03:02.566
- Saizo, you're here.
- Sorry I'm late.

34
00:03:02.633 --> 00:03:05.433
Ugh! Razor Shell.

35
00:03:14.166 --> 00:03:16.666
- Ippei.
- It's too dangerous. Stay away.

36
00:03:16.733 --> 00:03:21.500
Listen to me. Hanzo was just captured by some mysterious ninja.

37
00:03:21.566 --> 00:03:22.966
They got the chief?

38
00:03:24.133 --> 00:03:25.666
It seems I'm outnumbered.

39
00:03:26.033 --> 00:03:28.600
But it looks I've also bought enough time.

40
00:03:28.666 --> 00:03:30.166
Bisharp, return.

41
00:03:34.833 --> 00:03:40.066
Stop there. Going after him won't help. Our chief has fallen into enemy hands.

42
00:03:40.133 --> 00:03:43.866
If we act carelessly, we may lose our opportunity to save him.

43
00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:46.400
We need to create a plan.

44
00:03:46.866 --> 00:03:49.166
- They're retreating.
- Yeah, but why?

45
00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:53.733
They left because they accomplished what they came to do.

46
00:03:58.066 --> 00:04:01.166
Kagetomo and his henchmen kidnapped the chief.

47
00:04:01.233 --> 00:04:02.066
No way.

48
00:04:02.433 --> 00:04:03.266
Oh, no.

49
00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:05.066
Kagetomo?

50
00:04:05.133 --> 00:04:06.433
Pika, pika.

51
00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:10.500
That's right. Kagetomo also used to live here in Ninja Village.

52
00:04:10.566 --> 00:04:11.933
I remember him well.

53
00:04:12.366 --> 00:04:14.133
He was a very powerful ninja.

54
00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:20.433
It's useless. You cannot escape.

55
00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:23.866
It would appear so.

56
00:04:25.033 --> 00:04:29.500
There's no reason for disguises, so why not show your face, Kagetomo?

57
00:04:29.566 --> 00:04:30.966
Still clever.

58
00:04:31.566 --> 00:04:33.433
You saw right through my mask.

59
00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:41.866
It was easy. Only a person who comes from Ninja Village would possess the skill

60
00:04:41.933 --> 00:04:45.666
to fashion a rope that is virtually impossible to escape from.

61
00:04:45.733 --> 00:04:49.266
- Kagetomo, huh?
- Battling him will be very difficult.

62
00:04:49.733 --> 00:04:51.766
Kagetomo's really that strong?

63
00:04:51.833 --> 00:04:54.366
He was expected to become the next chief.

64
00:04:54.433 --> 00:04:59.400
It was his destiny to become the leader of Ninja Village after Hanzo stepped down.

65
00:04:59.666 --> 00:05:00.566
But then...

66
00:05:03.233 --> 00:05:07.633
To continue to train along with and discover the possibilities of Pokémon

67
00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:10.066
to defend the people of the world.

68
00:05:10.133 --> 00:05:13.066
That, and that alone, is the role of the ninja.

69
00:05:13.133 --> 00:05:14.900
Ridiculous.

70
00:05:16.200 --> 00:05:17.833
I have great power,

71
00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:21.066
overwhelming power with which to rule the world.

72
00:05:21.133 --> 00:05:23.733
- Am I wrong?
- You flatter yourself.

73
00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:29.000
Incorrect. And I vow I will prove it,

74
00:05:29.366 --> 00:05:31.933
after I become leader of the Ninja Village.

75
00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:36.033
If you turn your back on our teachings, you will not be the leader.

76
00:05:36.466 --> 00:05:41.000
You will not have the role of chief, and you won't have the chief's emblem.

77
00:05:41.666 --> 00:05:46.066
And with that, Kagetomo and his follower, Heidayu, left the village.

78
00:05:47.766 --> 00:05:53.033
After that, Kagetomo and Heidayu trained more ninja and formed a ninja force.

79
00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:55.666
- And then--
- They kidnapped Chief Hanzo.

80
00:05:56.100 --> 00:06:00.333
Mm-hm. When I became aware of what the ninja force was planning,

81
00:06:00.400 --> 00:06:04.466
I decided to come here and warn the chief. However, I was too late.

82
00:06:05.066 --> 00:06:07.166
I sure hope he's doing all right.

83
00:06:07.866 --> 00:06:10.233
I can't bear thinking of anything bad.

84
00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:14.866
I've gotta do something. I'm rescuing the chief, now.

85
00:06:14.933 --> 00:06:17.500
- I'll go.
- Think this through, Ash.

86
00:06:17.566 --> 00:06:20.100
We have no idea where Hanzo's being held.

87
00:06:21.666 --> 00:06:25.633
I'm sure Hanzo's just fine. After all, he is the chief.

88
00:06:25.700 --> 00:06:30.600
The villagers are tracking his whereabouts. Let's see what they come up with.

89
00:06:32.633 --> 00:06:33.466
- Right.
- Right.

90
00:06:37.133 --> 00:06:40.800
Kagetomo, what is it exactly that you want?

91
00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:43.300
The chief's emblem, perhaps?

92
00:06:43.766 --> 00:06:47.300
If that's what you desire, it's in my pocket. Take it.

93
00:06:47.366 --> 00:06:49.666
- I won't steal it.
- What?

94
00:06:53.166 --> 00:06:55.433
You'll give it to me at the festival.

95
00:06:56.166 --> 00:06:58.866
Then you will announce this to the villagers:

96
00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:02.300
"I'm passing the leadership to Kagetomo."

97
00:07:02.366 --> 00:07:04.733
Only then will I let you go free.

98
00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:10.866
Even if I agreed to make such a ridiculous announcement,

99
00:07:10.933 --> 00:07:13.733
the villagers would never accept you as leader.

100
00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:15.600
I'll make them accept me.

101
00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:20.566
- I'll do it with my power.
- Hmm?

102
00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:28.766
The villagers have discovered our whereabouts.

103
00:07:28.833 --> 00:07:30.900
They'll be here shortly, Kagetomo.

104
00:07:30.966 --> 00:07:35.700
Everything is going as planned. My only need is Ippei. Intercept them.

105
00:07:35.766 --> 00:07:36.800
Right.

106
00:07:39.633 --> 00:07:42.400
- I'm certain it was the chief.
- Where?

107
00:07:42.466 --> 00:07:45.766
He was on Otori Mountain. Not very far from the summit.

108
00:07:45.833 --> 00:07:47.766
Then let's go rescue him, now.

109
00:07:54.666 --> 00:07:56.033
Wait. Hold on.

110
00:08:00.866 --> 00:08:02.033
It's Heidayu.

111
00:08:02.700 --> 00:08:05.133
- So, that's him?
- Pika, pika.

112
00:08:05.366 --> 00:08:07.600
Don't let them go any further!

113
00:08:13.366 --> 00:08:17.133
Listen, Saizo. Leave them to us and you go rescue the chief.

114
00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:18.233
Then let's go.

115
00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:22.500
All right, Bisharp, now stop them with X-Scissor. Go!

116
00:08:24.966 --> 00:08:26.300
Huh?

117
00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:28.466
You'll have to beat us.

118
00:08:28.533 --> 00:08:31.333
Luxray, now help us make certain they don't.

119
00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:32.799
Braixen, you, too.

120
00:08:36.533 --> 00:08:39.000
- Venusaur, let's go!
- Liepard, come out!

121
00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:43.433
- Venusaur.
- Lie.

122
00:08:50.666 --> 00:08:52.833
- Razor Leaf, now!
- Hyper Beam, go!

123
00:08:54.033 --> 00:08:57.733
- All right, Luxray, use Swift!
- Braixen, use Flamethrower!

124
00:08:58.933 --> 00:09:00.566
Luxray!

125
00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:09.800
Think of this as payback for before. Greninja, Night Slash!

126
00:09:10.833 --> 00:09:14.400
Pikachu, use Iron Tail! Frogadier, use Cut!

127
00:09:14.866 --> 00:09:16.000
Pikachu!

128
00:09:16.466 --> 00:09:17.900
Fury Cutter, go!

129
00:09:19.233 --> 00:09:20.333
Bisharp.

130
00:09:20.633 --> 00:09:23.733
Greninja!

131
00:09:26.733 --> 00:09:28.333
Frogadier.

132
00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:32.500
No, Greninja.

133
00:09:32.566 --> 00:09:33.966
Pikachu! Frogadier!

134
00:09:38.633 --> 00:09:39.600
Chief Hanzo.

135
00:09:40.400 --> 00:09:42.633
Why, Ippei, you're late.

136
00:09:45.400 --> 00:09:49.200
- Hanzo, are you hurt?
- There's no need to worry. I'm just fine.

137
00:09:49.266 --> 00:09:52.600
I grow weary of waiting. Time for our battle!

138
00:09:55.933 --> 00:09:57.033
Weavile.

139
00:09:58.633 --> 00:10:01.200
This will decide who deserves to be chief.

140
00:10:01.266 --> 00:10:04.100
Whoever wins will rule over Ninja Village.

141
00:10:04.900 --> 00:10:06.500
Weavile, go!

142
00:10:07.233 --> 00:10:08.066
Weavile!

143
00:10:08.133 --> 00:10:10.066
Now, attack it, head on.

144
00:10:15.466 --> 00:10:16.900
Here it comes, Braixen.

145
00:10:16.966 --> 00:10:19.533
- Luxray, dodge it, quick!
- Venusaur, dodge!

146
00:10:26.400 --> 00:10:31.400
Courageous. I'll admire that before I stop you all in your tracks.

147
00:10:31.466 --> 00:10:34.266
Pikachu, Frogadier, run and confuse them, Now!

148
00:10:36.633 --> 00:10:39.033
Greninja, get up close and then attack.

149
00:10:42.133 --> 00:10:43.533
Bisharp, Snarl!

150
00:10:43.600 --> 00:10:45.066
Bisharp!

151
00:10:50.533 --> 00:10:51.633
- Oh, no!
- Oh, no!

152
00:10:51.700 --> 00:10:54.600
Don't let up! Use Shadow Claw on Pikachu!

153
00:10:57.033 --> 00:10:58.400
Quick, Pikachu, get up!

154
00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:03.800
Bisharp!

155
00:11:06.033 --> 00:11:06.966
Pika, pika.

156
00:11:08.766 --> 00:11:09.966
Pikachu.

157
00:11:10.700 --> 00:11:12.200
Frogadier, whoa.

158
00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:15.933
Who's that Pokémon?

159
00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:21.700
It's Greninja!

160
00:11:22.666 --> 00:11:23.833
Greninja!

161
00:11:29.833 --> 00:11:31.466
Bisharp!

162
00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:32.933
Bisharp.

163
00:11:38.633 --> 00:11:40.366
Frogadier is evolving.

164
00:11:53.933 --> 00:11:54.933
Whoa.

165
00:11:57.300 --> 00:12:01.833
Greninja, the ninja Pokémon, and the final evolved form of Froakie.

166
00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:05.500
Greninja can compress water into sharp-edged throwing stars.

167
00:12:05.566 --> 00:12:09.900
With the grace of a ninja, it slips in and out of sight to attack from the shadows.

168
00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:13.900
Next time, it'll be our turn, Braixen.

169
00:12:13.966 --> 00:12:16.266
Luxray, get ready to go, too.

170
00:12:18.633 --> 00:12:21.933
- There's no way we're giving in, either.
- That's right.

171
00:12:30.133 --> 00:12:32.300
- Water Shuriken!
- Use Icy Wind.

172
00:12:35.300 --> 00:12:37.333
Pikachu, Electro Ball, now!

173
00:12:41.500 --> 00:12:43.366
Reflect it back with X-Scissor.

174
00:12:43.433 --> 00:12:45.666
Bisharp!

175
00:12:47.600 --> 00:12:49.233
Greninja, Water Shuriken!

176
00:12:52.733 --> 00:12:54.866
Bisharp.

177
00:12:55.633 --> 00:12:57.900
- Luxray.
- Braixen!

178
00:13:07.100 --> 00:13:08.666
Oh, yeah!

179
00:13:10.133 --> 00:13:11.600
You're not going to win.

180
00:13:12.233 --> 00:13:15.066
Kagetomo will become the chief!

181
00:13:16.033 --> 00:13:17.366
X-Scissor, go!

182
00:13:17.866 --> 00:13:19.800
Well, we're gonna be stronger.

183
00:13:20.633 --> 00:13:22.000
Let's go!

184
00:13:28.933 --> 00:13:30.600
Greninja, use Cut now!

185
00:13:31.466 --> 00:13:33.966
Greninja!

186
00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:49.300
What did Greninja just do?

187
00:13:58.833 --> 00:14:00.100
Use Metal Claw!

188
00:14:01.700 --> 00:14:03.266
Greninja, get away!

189
00:14:06.466 --> 00:14:08.600
Kagetomo's Weavile is strong.

190
00:14:08.666 --> 00:14:13.200
The speed and the power of its moves are as impressive as Ippei's Greninja.

191
00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:16.233
Maybe more impressive. But...

192
00:14:16.300 --> 00:14:18.966
Now, run it down, and then smash it.

193
00:14:20.600 --> 00:14:22.166
Greninja, dodge it!

194
00:14:25.233 --> 00:14:26.800
Greninja.

195
00:14:26.866 --> 00:14:28.533
Excellent work, Greninja.

196
00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:33.533
Ippei has something that Kagetomo does not, and it is...

197
00:14:34.300 --> 00:14:35.300
Ippei!

198
00:14:35.900 --> 00:14:37.900
- Saizo!
- Pika.

199
00:14:37.966 --> 00:14:40.066
- How's it going?
- No need to worry.

200
00:14:40.633 --> 00:14:44.300
- Ippei and Greninja will prevail. Watch.
- Hmm.

201
00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:48.933
I'd say it's about time to wrap this up.

202
00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:51.966
I will return to Ninja Village as its leader.

203
00:14:52.400 --> 00:14:57.433
- Arg. All right, Weavile, Giga Impact!
- Weavile!

204
00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:59.700
Now! Greninja, Double Team!

205
00:15:11.433 --> 00:15:12.400
Now.

206
00:15:13.366 --> 00:15:14.200
Below you.

207
00:15:21.766 --> 00:15:25.500
I will defend the honor of the ninja with everything I've got.

208
00:15:25.566 --> 00:15:27.200
Greninja, Water Shuriken!

209
00:15:35.600 --> 00:15:36.700
Weavile.

210
00:15:38.833 --> 00:15:41.700
Get up, Weavile! What do you think you're doing?

211
00:15:41.766 --> 00:15:43.133
Why won't you fight?!

212
00:15:47.400 --> 00:15:49.700
That's enough. The battle is over.

213
00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:51.133
Over?

214
00:16:03.200 --> 00:16:04.266
I lost.

215
00:16:05.100 --> 00:16:05.933
How?

216
00:16:09.333 --> 00:16:12.600
Ippei has something, something that you do not have,

217
00:16:13.400 --> 00:16:15.866
and that thing is devotion.

218
00:16:17.366 --> 00:16:20.000
He battles for the dreams of the people.

219
00:16:20.066 --> 00:16:24.300
He gives everything he's got for the future of each and every Pokémon.

220
00:16:24.933 --> 00:16:30.100
Everything, for the people, the Pokémon, and the whole world.

221
00:16:31.366 --> 00:16:33.433
That is the way of the ninja,

222
00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:36.533
and that is the reason you were defeated.

223
00:16:42.333 --> 00:16:45.200
And why you weren't chosen as village leader.

224
00:16:45.466 --> 00:16:48.100
My faith in Ippei's Greninja is unwavering

225
00:16:48.166 --> 00:16:51.166
because I knew it would battle until the very end.

226
00:16:53.333 --> 00:16:56.100
Your Weavile battled well indeed, Kagetomo.

227
00:16:56.633 --> 00:16:58.833
It deserves your praise and respect.

228
00:16:58.900 --> 00:16:59.733
Ippei.

229
00:17:04.566 --> 00:17:07.033
You battled very well. Thanks, Weavile.

230
00:17:07.099 --> 00:17:08.333
Weavile.

231
00:17:08.400 --> 00:17:10.300
You are indeed a fine ninja.

232
00:17:11.066 --> 00:17:15.300
Use your power for the people, the Pokémon, and for the whole world.

233
00:17:16.733 --> 00:17:17.633
Hmm.

234
00:17:23.766 --> 00:17:27.366
That's excellent, Ash. I see your Frogadier evolved as well.

235
00:17:27.433 --> 00:17:32.300
I'm so excited. That makes three of us. All our Frogadier evolved into Greninja!

236
00:17:32.366 --> 00:17:34.700
We're gonna get stronger and stronger.

237
00:17:34.766 --> 00:17:38.533
You just wait. We're gonna get even stronger than you two.

238
00:17:38.600 --> 00:17:41.766
- I look forward to seeing your progress.
- Thanks.

239
00:17:41.833 --> 00:17:43.700
- Ninja.
- Pika!

240
00:17:50.233 --> 00:17:51.766
After much consideration,

241
00:17:51.833 --> 00:17:55.500
I have decided who will be the next chief of Ninja Village.

242
00:17:57.033 --> 00:18:02.166
And that will be the fine young man standing next to me, Ippei.

243
00:18:27.666 --> 00:18:30.533
So, will you be leaving the village, Kagetomo?

244
00:18:31.666 --> 00:18:36.166
Yes. I must rededicate my training and I have a lot to think about.

245
00:18:36.633 --> 00:18:40.633
You could accomplish all of that here in Ninja Village, you know?

246
00:18:40.833 --> 00:18:43.166
I cannot forget what you both told me.

247
00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:45.533
Words of wisdom.

248
00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:47.933
If my power is for the world,

249
00:18:48.433 --> 00:18:50.566
I must first see what the world is,

250
00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:52.266
all by myself.

251
00:18:53.266 --> 00:18:55.533
Heidayu, is that your plan?

252
00:18:55.600 --> 00:18:57.933
Hmm. I will follow Kagetomo,

253
00:18:58.633 --> 00:18:59.900
wherever he goes.

254
00:19:00.433 --> 00:19:04.400
Ninja Village will be waiting for your return. Don't forget.

255
00:19:05.033 --> 00:19:06.300
I promise you.

256
00:19:12.133 --> 00:19:15.266
And my ninja, please watch over them.

257
00:19:16.466 --> 00:19:17.766
With all that I have.

258
00:19:28.566 --> 00:19:32.966
- Thank you so much for everything.
- The ninja festival was so much fun.

259
00:19:34.566 --> 00:19:38.266
I hope you'll come and pay us a visit whenever you're nearby.

260
00:19:38.333 --> 00:19:39.733
You're always welcome.

261
00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:42.100
Thanks. That's so very nice of you.

262
00:19:42.800 --> 00:19:46.166
Best of luck, Ash. Now go and win your eighth Gym Badge!

263
00:19:46.233 --> 00:19:50.366
- I'll cheer you all the way.
- Thanks. Good luck to you too, Sanpei.

264
00:19:50.433 --> 00:19:53.033
- Pika, pika.
- Gren.

265
00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:55.033
- Thank you.
- Greninja.

266
00:19:57.100 --> 00:20:01.066
Now that the festival and the battle for Ninja Village has ended,

267
00:20:01.133 --> 00:20:04.200
our heroes are off once again to Snowbelle City,

268
00:20:04.266 --> 00:20:08.466
where Ash will battle for his eighth and final Kalos Gym Badge.

269
00:20:15.300 --> 00:20:18.566
Wait, Ash's Greninja took on a new appearance?

270
00:20:19.033 --> 00:20:21.300
Yes. But it was only for an instant.

271
00:20:29.333 --> 00:20:30.866
You know what that means.

272
00:20:30.933 --> 00:20:34.500
The village hero from long ago has protected us once again.

273
00:20:35.300 --> 00:20:37.000
Greninja, of course.
